WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.790
This six-stage workflow organizes the module Profile
first

00:00:07.527 --> 00:00:13.316
Preserve the source Normalize representation where
the rule is known

00:00:15.071 --> 00:00:20.606
Validate values against documented rules Resolve
duplicates

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:26.267
or questionable rows with explicit logic Finally
move stable

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:31.995
rules closer to data entry through constraints or
monitoring The order matters

00:00:32.022 --> 00:00:35.798
because prevention should come after you understand
the data and the rules
